Purpose

This document records the completion and approval of Atlas Core Concepts (ACC) Version 1.0.

Upon approval, the concepts, definitions, relationships, and principles defined within ACC SHALL constitute the canonical conceptual foundation of the Atlas Engineering Cognition Framework (AECF).

