Stability

ACC Version 1.0 SHALL be treated as stable.

Future specifications SHALL reference ACC rather than redefining its concepts.

Compatibility

Minor revisions MAY:

clarify wording
correct editorial errors
improve examples

Minor revisions SHALL NOT:

redefine canonical concepts
alter concept relationships
invalidate existing specifications

Major revisions MAY introduce:

new canonical concepts
ontology extensions
architectural refinements
Normative Requirement

All Atlas specifications SHALL conform to ACC Version 1.0 unless an explicitly approved future version supersedes it.